OL,3,GNEWSAShotgun murderer jailed for at
OL,4,Aleast 28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered an acquaintance with
OL,7,Fa shotgun in Nottingham has been jailed
OL,8,Ffor life.
OL,10,FJack Preston gunned down Coel Tainton,
OL,11,F24, at his rented property in Ryeland
OL,12,FGardens, in The Meadows, at about 05:30
OL,13,FGMT on 28 February after an argument.
OL,15,FPreston originally claimed a masked
OL,16,Fintruder was responsible, but then
OL,17,Flater said the gun had gone off
OL,18,Faccidentally during a struggle after
OL,19,FTainton tried to rob him. However,
OL,20,FPreston was convicted of murder last
OL,21,Fweek following a trial.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
