OL,3,GNEWSAShotgun murderer jailed for at
OL,4,Aleast 28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Nottingham Crown Court on Thursday
OL,7,FJudge Nirmal Shant gave the 34-year-old
OL,8,Fa minimum jail term of 28 years, saying
OL,9,Fthe victim "presented no threat to
OL,10,Fyou".
